# Functional Requirements

## Student shall be able to

- Browse activities
- Search activities
- Filter by category
- Filter by campus
- Filter by date
- View activity details
- Register for activities
- Cancel reservations


## Activity Organizer shall be able to

- Create activities
- Edit activities
- Publish activities
- Cancel activities
- Approve registrations
- Record attendance
- Issue certificates
- Generate reports

## Student Affairs shall be able to

- Manage categories
- Approve activities
- Monitor participation
- Generate institutional reports
- Verify transcripts

## System shall be able to

- Send notifications
- Manage waiting lists
- Promote students automatically
- Generate activity transcripts
